	(text "5v in (needs to be filtered) (pi filter/ferrite beads)\nBest approach should be to use pi filter based on buck's frequency, and then use ferrite beads after that\n\n3.3v LDO (TPS767D301PWPR)\n\n(need to ask for current requirements)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
